<title>USA: Ormet Corp raises aluminum prices from September 1.</title>
<headline>Ormet Corp raises aluminum prices from September 1.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-07-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Ormet Primary Aluminum Corp said it has increased by one cent per pound the prices on all extrusion billet alloys for orders shipped on or after September 1.</p>
<p>The price increases include an additional two cents per pound upcharge for alloy 6061 and the 6063 base price.</p>
<p>Effective the same date, Ormet said it will add a one cent per pound premium on all six inch diameter billet and an additional one cent per pound premium on cut lengths of 20 inches or less on all diameters of billet.</p>
<p>((New York Commodity Desk 212-859-1646))</p>
</text>
